Subject: separate active HTML tags from retained node boundaries
Upstream-Status: Local safety fix (not submitted)

Mark held tags detached when closing an enclosing tag removes them from
the stack. Release a detached node boundary without closing unrelated
ancestors. Preserve attached closed PRE tags during native fill transitions
and detach an ended PRE without closing newly opened list containers.

